{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21054","headline":"崑仑使者 · 李贺","name":"崑仑使者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崑仑使者无消息，茂陵烟树生愁色。\n金盘玉露自淋漓，元气茫茫收不得。\n麒麟背上石文裂，虬龙鳞下红枝折。\n何处偏伤万国心，中天夜久高明月。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21054.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21054","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗品彚（附唐诗拾遗）》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩品彚_(四庫全書本)）"}